      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARMONICA (7) is a capable type and proved too strong last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 26.29 beating Gertie Gout. The one to beat again. MAGICAL GEM (4) looks close to win after hitting the frame last run (25.33) at Goulburn in a Mix. Has first look at box 4 this time. Goes very well here finding the frame in each of three starts. Good beginner but will need a little luck from a middle draw. Well placed and gets his chance. PAW KITTY (2) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a Grade 5 at this track over 330m. Rates a winning chance on best. SECRET FAITH (1) should be thereabouts.",
